    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DNG GLEN CORCORAN are delighted to present to the market this superb three-bedroom semi-detached bungalow, ideally situated in the village of Crinkle, just c. 3.5km from the heart of Birr Town Centre. Offering a wonderful balance of village living and convenient access to local amenities, this attractive home is ideally suited to a wide range of purchasers.\r\n\r\nConstructed circa 2006, the popular Southgate development comprises just 12 bungalows, creating a quiet and welcoming residential setting. The development enjoys beautiful views of the Slieve Bloom Mountains and the surrounding countryside, providing a tranquil backdrop while remaining within easy reach of schools, shops, sporting facilities and all the services available in Birr.\r\n\r\nInternally, the property is presented in excellent condition throughout, having been well maintained by its current owners. The bright and spacious accommodation offers comfortable, modern living and is ready for immediate occupation, allowing its new owners to move in with minimal effort. The well-proportioned layout is ideal for families, retirees or those seeking the convenience of single-storey living.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property enjoys a generous driveway to the front, providing ample off-street parking. To the rear is a secure, fully enclosed garden offering a private outdoor space that is perfect for children, pets or entertaining. \r\n\r\nCombining an excellent location, quality accommodation and a peaceful residential setting, this is a fantastic opportunity to acquire a turnkey home in one of the Birr area's most desirable developments. The property is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, families, downsizers and owner-occupiers alike.\r\n\r\nViewing of this outstanding property comes highly recommended and is strictly by appointment with the sole selling agents, DNG GLEN CORCORAN."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - (5.60m x 1.42m)\r\nTastefully Decorated Entrance Hall with Semi Solid Timber Floors, Moulded Plaster Cornicing & Centre Rose.\r\n\r\nKitchen - (6.62m x 3.34m)\r\nBright & Spacious Kitchen/Diner with a good selection of wall & base units with integrated appliances, tiled splashback, vinyl flooring, moulded plaster cornicing & centre rose & recessed downlighters.\r\n\r\nSitting Room - (4.98m x 4.12m)\r\nTastefully Decorated, this Bright & Spacious Sitting Room comes with Semi Solid Timber Flooring, Feature Fireplace with Solid Fuel Stove, Moulded Plaster Cornicing & Centre Rose.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - (4.27m x 3.21m)\r\nLocated to the Rear of the House, this Tastefully Decorated Bright & Spacious Bedroom comes with Cornicing to Ceilings and is Tastefully Decorated.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - (3.68m x 2.77m)\r\nLocated to the Front of the House, this Tastefully Decorated Bright & Spacious Bedroom comes with Carpet to Floors,\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - (3.07m x 2.73m)\r\nLocated to the Rear of the House, this Tastefully Decorated Bright & Spacious Bedroom comes with Carpet to Floors,\r\n\r\nBathroom - (3.21m x 2.05m)\r\nSpacious Family Bathroom comes with Fully Tiled Walls, WC, Bath, Vanity Unit & Shower Enclosure with Electric Shower"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Excellent Condition Throughout - 'Turn Key'\r\nIn Close Proximity to Crinkle Primary School\r\nConveniently located in close proximity to Crinkle & Birr\r\nEnclosed Rear Garden\r\nOil Fired Central Heating\r\nDouble Glazed Hardwood Windows & External Doors\r\nQuiet residential development of just 12 bungalows"
      },
